[{"speaker":"","text":"我们立马中止约会，冲进神社确认宿体的情况。","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"但看起来并没什么特别的变化。","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「唔……是那对耳朵没错」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a145","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「怎么会，为什么现在还会出现……？宿体碎片不都集齐了吗？」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a145","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a550","position":"出","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「宿体依旧没什么变化是吧？」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a145","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a550","position":"出","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「唔。通过供奉，污秽肯定是被削弱了。但是为什么……？」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a293","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a550","position":"出","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「有什么……其他的理由吗？」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1174","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「诅咒不可能毫无缘由地持续……关键在于其原因」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a145","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这个供奉在这里的宿体并没有破损，而且也毫无动静，也就是说……」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a145","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「还有别的宿体？」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a145","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「……还不好说。总之先考虑一下现在可能发生的状况吧」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a145","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「如果和以往一样的话……今晚祟神应该会出现」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a145","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「没错」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1160","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"还以为一切都已经结束了……没想到还会再发生这样的事。","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是……最受打击的当然并不是我。","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a310","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"朝武一脸五味杂陈的表情。","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a310","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"我犹豫了好久该对她说些什么……但结果还是什么都想不到。","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a310","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"身为恋人，我必须充当她的后盾。","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a310","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"但我到底该说些什么才能让她振作，又不给她压力呢？","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a310","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a310","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"不！我都在想些什么啊！在这种重要时刻，我怎么能自己先心情沉重起来！","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a310","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"我愁眉苦脸的样子会让朝武感到难过的。","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a310","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……嗯，对了」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a310","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「有地？」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1142","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「别担心。这种小事我立马就能解决。不，我一定会解决」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1142","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「否则就不能安心继续了」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1142","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「继、继续……听起来好下流」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1769","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这是我的真实想法。在那种情况下被打断，总感觉有头无尾的，我很不好受啊」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1769","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「为了能安心地继续，我一定会解决这件事。所以，我们再来一起努力吧」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1142","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「之前也想方设法地解决了。这次也不会有问题的。有我在」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1142","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……好的」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1164","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"茉子・丛雨","text":"『……』","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a204","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1160","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「继续来继续去的……你们二位发展到什么程度了啊～？」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a290","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「难道说都发展到办那种事了？」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a249","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"常陆也配合着我以活泼的声音说道。","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a249","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「哎哎哎！？」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1770","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「在青天白日之下就突然上阵……你们俩挺能干的啊」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a132","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1169","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"或许是察觉到了我们的意图，小雨也变回了平时的样子。","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a132","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1169","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「芳乃大人自己都说觉得下流了。到底都被他做了些什么呀……啊哈」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a132","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1169","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a292","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「不、不是的！我、我们才没干那种不知廉耻的事，没有啊」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a132","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1771","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a292","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「又来了，用不着隐瞒的」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a132","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1771","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a281","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「是啊。本座都活了几百年了，总不至于连这点事都看不出来」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a129","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1771","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a281","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「才、才没有隐瞒。真的没做什么不知廉耻的事」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a129","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1772","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a281","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「那你说你们做了什么？」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a137","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「这个……」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1773","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「果然是羞得不能跟人说的事」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1774","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1775","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「才不是羞得不能跟人说！只是……嘴唇碰了碰而已」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1774","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a1776","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「但也就是轻轻地碰了碰！只是轻轻地亲了一下而已。一、一点都没有不知廉耻」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1777","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「朝武，太直白了，你的自白太直白了……」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[{"asset":"a1777","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「总之，今晚进山里看看吧」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「如果祟神出现，并且能够回收宿体的碎片的话，就说明还有其他的碎片」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「到时再收集就可以了」","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"问题是祟神没出现的情况。","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"那样的话，那谜团就更深了……","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"总而言之，现在只能等到晚上。","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"先好好休息为祓禊做准备吧。","art":{"background":"a1657","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们坐立不安地等待时间过去，吃完晚饭后进入山里。","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"我自然带上了丛雨丸。","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"山里很安静。","art":{"background":"a374","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"时不时能听到虫鸣声，没有任何不自然的地方。","art":{"background":"a374","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们无言地感知着周围的气息。","art":{"background":"a374","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a374","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是感觉不到有什么东西接近。","art":{"background":"a374","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"这种平静的时间持续了一个小时多。","art":{"background":"a374","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"自从我开始参加祓禊以来，还没花过这么长的时间。","art":{"background":"a374","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"以前的话，最多二十分钟，祟神就会出现在我们面前。","art":{"background":"a374","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「以前有过祟神这么久还没出现的情况吗？」","art":{"background":"a374","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「不……遗憾的是……之前没发生过这样的情况」","art":{"background":"a374","sprites":[{"asset":"a1369","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……是吗……」","art":{"background":"a374","sprites":[{"asset":"a1369","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"看样子……并不是像以前那样有宿体四散在山里。","art":{"background":"a374","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"宿体或许只有在神社里供奉的那一个。","art":{"background":"a374","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"那么，为什么她长出了耳朵……？","art":{"background":"a374","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"根据小雨所说，怨念应该正在不断平息……","art":{"background":"a374","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「所以，祟神那边怎么样？」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a309","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「很遗憾……」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a309","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"我轻轻摇了摇头，回答道。","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a309","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「是吗……那就是说还有其他的原因……不过……」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a307","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「……从来没有过这样的前例……」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a243","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"说到底，宿体碎片集齐的情况本就是史上头一遭，一头雾水也是很正常的。","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a243","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「总之，现在还是去休息比较好。你们也累了吧？」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a306","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「安晴说得没错。特别是芳乃，你最好用热水洗净一下污秽」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a223","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「好的。我这就去」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a1778","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「茉子，麻烦你了」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a243","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「好的，我知道了」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a1779","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽然朝武她现在并没有很失落，但她不可能一点都不放在心上。","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"现在朝武的身边需要有人来陪。","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"按道理，这或许应该是我的任务……但我到底是不可能连浴室都跟着一起进去。","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我也回房间了」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「我知道了。要好好休息」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a309","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「感谢您的关心」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a309","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"安晴","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a348","sprites":[{"asset":"a356","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是这样一来……就真的陷入谜团之中了。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「为什么事到如今还会被诅咒的怨念缠上？」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「主人，能详细说明一下长出耳朵时的状况吗？」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a373","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你要我详细说我也说不清……」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a373","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「因为和朝武走在一起太引人注目了，所以为了不引人注意，我们就进入了山里」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a373","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「后来我们吃了便当，接着就接吻了」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a373","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a204","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我没有因为害羞而隐瞒什么。真的是没有别的好说的」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a204","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「进入山里的时候，没有觉得不对劲，也没感觉到什么奇怪的气息？」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a282","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"也有可能是与恋人共处的兴奋让我忽略了所有异常。","art":{"background":"a1096","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是……在身边的朝武长出耳朵之前，我都没感觉有什么不对劲。","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「应该是没有」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「小雨，你也一点头绪都没有吗？」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「……抱歉」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a261","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"小雨移开视线，平静地跟我道歉。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a261","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「总之，今晚本座就去通宵监视宿体吧。过去本座只在早晨和傍晚才去确认」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a361","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「那我也一起去」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a361","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「没必要。本座一晚不睡也没有什么问题」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a277","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「但是……」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a277","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「本座保证，若是发生什么事便会立马报告主人」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a133","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「毕竟，光凭本座一个人也是什么都做不到啊」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a277","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……我知道了。不好意思，那就拜托你了」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a277","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「唔，交给本座吧」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a130","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"小雨用力地点点头，然后很快就离开了房间。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"……现在就先听小雨的话，把宿体那边交给她负责吧。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「话说回来……」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「诅咒……还没有解除啊……」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"原本传说中就没有提到过解除诅咒的具体方法。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"只是我发现了宿体的碎片，因此解除的可能性很高而已。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"但事实上，诅咒还没有解除……","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「但是祟神没有出现。朝武他们也说这种事是第一次发生」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"也就是说诅咒发生了变化。至少不是白忙一场。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"但光是这样还不足够……","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"要平息祟神的愤怒，还需要什么别的东西吗……？","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我必须得更加了解诅咒才行」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不过……都这么晚了。也不好现在去打扰驹川大夫」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊，对了。那些资料我还没还给她呢」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"以前借来的归纳了诅咒相关知识的笔记本。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"记得借来之后就一直放在这里……","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊，找到了」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽然以前看过这些资料，但现在回头看看或许会有什么新发现。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"总之现在就先干自己力所能及的事吧。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-3"}]